{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.house",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "傍晚，她趴在屋顶的围栏上",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.house",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.house",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──要回家的话，我开车送你吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────啊，好的……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？にちか？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……哇，什么啊！很近诶！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，抱歉，想问问你怎么了。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……好像，有股好闻的味道。花，之类的。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊────",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────嗯，真的。一定是哪种花吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "说了吧，我……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，原谅我吧。再多的话我说不出来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么说呢……像是夏天来之前的那种味道────",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……────",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "稍微走回去吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶诶，那车怎么办？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "因为我说了可以嘛──！……我一个人走回去哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，等等にちか────！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────嗯────！哈啊────……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦哦……好棒的傍晚啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "这里，超好的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊，感觉像是能把一切看遍。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "平时在那一带走的时候，净是房子，什么都没有，真觉得是个超无聊的镇子──",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "从这里看，就好像一格一格都有人住着……到了傍晚就回来，那种感觉。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "自己平时，也就是回那里去的一个人啊──那种。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……确实，坐着那班公交，在那家超市买东西────",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "完全，没有梦想吧──。即使那种的──",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我是一直想着要盖一栋的哦……等我变成大明星！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "给家里人的家！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "姐姐啊，爷爷啊奶奶啊",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "在医院里的妈妈啊，现在不住在一起的叔叔们啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "还有将来会变多的家人！就是那种，大家都会回来的地方。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嘿，这样啊──────",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────原来にちか，是这样笑的啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──────盖得起来哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能盖起来的。にちか会变成大明星的。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────……！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────哇，什么啊，诶──……为什么我会说这种事……",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……姐姐那边，请保密哦──……！",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……这样啊，是秘密啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "与其说秘密……又不是一定变得成大明星啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶，是那种事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……那种事……",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，にちか说那种话要怎么办啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────にちか……！要变成大明星的────！",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "等……！制作人先生！！！你是笨蛋吗！？这么大声────",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────大声喊的，不是にちか吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在事务所的屋顶，说『要在这里当偶像』────大声喊出来的，是にちか。",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "收不回去了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……────────",
        "nextNodeId": "50"
      },
      "50": {
        "id": "50",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────要……变成大明星────！！！！",
        "nextNodeId": "51"
      },
      "51": {
        "id": "51",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈，嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "52"
      },
      "52": {
        "id": "52",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────……就是这样！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
